{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7397c132a5d4e98255388251feb0add456f29a72b1fe0c8a69b5e9b12bbebeb6",
      "source_sha256": "35b47faf4358186c05ab2a2b61e7c8e70ca2bf816860c2c92b307d2ae75a4da7",
      "translation": "哎呀呀……真是来了位贵客啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:777b9eaa6c63c9450b12800ccf40df596944c7939a10417d4148f118c2d0b0bd",
      "source_sha256": "cf46b83d0b1fa45a326a16664e42176fb32829419fb0458444bcc18ea4e55152",
      "translation": "你是……阿尔贝多？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2e557084ab0b85698af97f087a4be2811dc8d342b64c3191380d90c82cc6ba12",
      "source_sha256": "997186c1b0df813eb0e5b318f880fbc085dac3515311c54799014edefc5775df",
      "translation": "呵，青月特雷瓦族长，阿尔戈。不，现在只是个无能的蠢货了吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7b6976596bb631216d9c54bf31af12c86005c4e329626cab23fa2c7c085ee911",
      "source_sha256": "04094d62904761fb22c1c6245a8ebb52dff00e263133f7f261b9bc717ea6eccd",
      "translation": "阿尔贝多，你怎么会干起这种事？竟然成了盗贼团的首领。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:af0587fa92ffdebfaced3ff808573c7f5cacc7f9a6c385becbbd61da277d5480",
      "source_sha256": "763df2ac303025be24b219d2d392b2205fd5c3a4f751dc66367a4f38ee1c51b8",
      "translation": "既然如此，就不能这么放你走了……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7c14209ecb710c9d46b8cec712dbea89f0b570432399c84161071c289af4a390",
      "source_sha256": "435cac5d08bc679ac29f75b19bb694967fc849f7c8782fdf4da367fa123132eb",
      "translation": "如果你承认自己的罪，就在这里，乖乖偿还吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4e480d6574d9df8d50a5bc3bfaa47ad65a7e1b062f382c8de9773daeea9b61a8",
      "source_sha256": "4fd898da148b874606c0bfc64b314410739b81a0a0a7de0faae672033a899fa3",
      "translation": "我还不能死在这里。对不起，阿尔贝多。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a6065f2f5442c4e409ec01d2940be1424c150191d6b962fdffaf222ea026c71c",
      "source_sha256": "586f35ec9eed150d047c0efebcee28db9eaef98a0bc3e7a7c5a4453d32d4ec04",
      "translation": "呵……哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11e1b9c0a41f1c15423a7e35f853ce978e6df324a89b0013386370eaa0704cb7",
      "source_sha256": "9b71390aff39d57a8ae362876085285630aed97df2e066256d4687b8bd55a95c",
      "translation": "果然，还是舍不得自己的命吗？明明是你，把整个部族都推向了死亡！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:25ae5a9b557864aca61ddef928e4b29827b502ff1f1e5fce9ea8d974f1eaf1d2",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2fff0699a28e32158cc0faf6e86dd66aea61ce9d0d04ca9d9c23d1e70eeb3c6c",
      "source_sha256": "a5dff2ed61d3b0515607703560ed8fc5206103bebead5a48c1978ead4c5c7504",
      "translation": "拿起武器，阿尔戈。我会让你好好见识，背叛者的下场。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:27130bcec1c4efc79246346693f57575ec05f2fb4d70582172f3adce050a82c5",
      "source_sha256": "fed2ac14a0ff5e9051eb3668245d1ad6a6df6f5c461f3ae1002bd0348639a9b8",
      "translation": "鲁坦是这样，你也是这样……到底，到底为什么？为什么非要这样互相残杀！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1ec0f78d02fc8ad5e22e7eb2a568f5da2389cd8c3ab4cd337b34d9bc14ef8b3e",
      "source_sha256": "d7fd204924f013dbe1ef04f71e3c8dd57cbf011c3f96677ec825ddcda074f305",
      "translation": "唔……不愧是青月特雷瓦的族长……果然不是好对付的对手。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8353a154e625651518882f8ddd49e12eac651b15f700bfafb0f64cb9f13d009e",
      "source_sha256": "593a1e2596b70de576714cac98f817b180bf3c2ec59899cfec4eede648cc5273",
      "translation": "对不起，阿尔贝多。我本来不想和你交手。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35fc5fd6c14df5930fa196bf566793add4ba88b99dc4e9a28e90d8e735ea29d9",
      "source_sha256": "e0145eb9c57cbce035e230edf9baee6d0bd3226404ed1d4feb053624afcc7117",
      "translation": "阿尔戈……道歉也改变不了任何事。那种话，没有用。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2d88181c5ae6baf064d9255c588682e932553f48c66b6fdfc56d76ef34d710f2",
      "source_sha256": "ead4b445dbe3c928e1be3e43de191843230678d16ab130fe65e3c47dfbdcf52f",
      "translation": "如果你真的想赎罪，还有别的事该做。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:daec5d87d511e007150f206e3804122ce16cf4f5cdc884ee320c53d71142ed4b",
      "source_sha256": "5165f9eab74dbc3e9a5a980cff7cf3dcfb9d2bb35727931bc5ce79ceceeea433",
      "translation": "该做的事……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:455db382ff3711cb450c3e0f4762239a251176c70312a216a5d4e5231daff2e3",
      "source_sha256": "b77dfa391a2072975a67f1ae536c1ef0df612c211b7ff35e78718314ada40db4",
      "translation": "在鲁哈尔特高原……活下来的青月特雷瓦族人，正聚在那里……生活。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5352b4b32b8cfca0a48a9a0007d6774138c66da1e5fda43a7eea51e83af40d0f",
      "source_sha256": "6bf16c312c4a0744c6276b9a7b40bde61fc922e939767618cf661e335040ad42",
      "translation": "为了给青月部族，建一个新的家园。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:906cd2bd92f00b739abd62434062c87d42cb77e7bd7b366ce62691f7b882ecf7",
      "source_sha256": "17d17e05dbbc8c01aa4a68debebb45c16046a21c071e98530e8f0ec4b22bae8c",
      "translation": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1c8e3f4b3683b939a1261b921050e23eff2f0a000f00e4d5be0e3a92de21b410",
      "source_sha256": "74d36e7aa95e6df17fceaf87930239febc5a97776d3e79b5f390735354ac3db6",
      "translation": "有黑角特雷瓦从中阻挠，现在还很简陋……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9476216a7f71b4757d189f838a938abf1ee48e76f5494664d08b876647540eec",
      "source_sha256": "c524b20fc277079b9a45b306141be108846b6c639187f003f78461c1a694fa36",
      "translation": "不过，总有一天，一定会变成一座像样的村庄吧……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2c663cfff58b201903b75ad62cacd3651ec63d4b7ce6f0262a77d4add7271e87",
      "source_sha256": "4dbcf1e1d67eff60054f6cb9777326811ea1b2605012694d363bc39c0c7d3159",
      "translation": "他们也曾请我去帮忙，可我这双手，已经因偷盗而弄脏，实在没脸到那里去。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d9336c47731452eec529410019664d8b37f6143462376ddf9f5ea1da61eff591",
      "source_sha256": "4a962f3c30f0b5067d32e1cfd67469c5f31b840a8e95ec51291a53dd6d02bce2",
      "translation": "但是……你不一样。去……帮帮他们吧。咳，咳……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5f8185db5c7ba5ff3340a32f57f5955d9d4fcb0698144ab94b57b8ef2e2483b1",
      "source_sha256": "bc8be2c3846065ac5887977bc8166e69100bd9ad66af4461ca03774231099a35",
      "translation": "阿尔贝多！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:840d3b53e1c51ecaf72ccffe7792c11a097b21c02f244a941792e9f4901f842f",
      "source_sha256": "7b2747fc29dc21fde4f226b3eba60f227900058c0b053f7472929f0cb345ee27",
      "translation": "你是他们的族长。去帮帮他们吧。帮帮……鲁哈尔特的同胞……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:978fa9ae76e92de7c4f34f972ec14d8f22874a073c3948af757ee024dfc1bcf7",
      "source_sha256": "5e551355b6ab5b43698fd893a9a9cb619106fb9b7d9419a4dac2deacbbe2e244",
      "translation": "振作点，阿尔贝多！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a3330e5fe93ed95f1c55e5a71f4fef0acc4502d27795ec6e78d5393d840c8b68",
      "source_sha256": "8dbb7e88f0ecc75131d98b69c0929c4d356ea8f00cf762cad3655936b0499a24",
      "translation": "阿尔贝多……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0546654d08a2bed734a7ae2086dc9537cc8451648c9ff5c514d8fb25f0e6db54",
      "source_sha256": "13e9ae48c7a591407d7e6a705265532453090871a42f9e937ee4cbd6196117b5",
      "translation": "阿尔戈哥哥……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d689f01993fcfe5341eef0999cbfbcbe8b5a78c86b617cbf848e1128a4e1fb11",
      "source_sha256": "49e8843f4ceac1e3943a00576e61f23bb185cf5e79be330f496aaeed48a80d84",
      "translation": "前往[鲁哈尔特高原]，\\n寻找青月特雷瓦族聚居并正在重建的村庄。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a05fc750673540cb2370815de7dac8767b613df13004d8371d5a4482c22538a",
      "source_sha256": "03a43cf097884beb0b9add6fe7f4b0a1f22fe9cb501378d376bbf3b8b07a53f9",
      "translation": "青月重建"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3430b58608fbcd02abae4388000f95ca73e7647331b97da9fc4060776cce80cf",
      "source_sha256": "a45f1d3d3b7ff3d9af14723a266f1d02aedd871d03369b6f9f8cbbc7a97bbcfc",
      "translation": "等你很久了，阿尔戈族长。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6dfb4b07d59b383092f8e089e4ab818a0af2e1a6488377fe8ca0cb8d6118a414",
      "source_sha256": "5086348a795fe4a669eaabaf2fb001e53660effa7d52ad834f2870eb56dd00c4",
      "translation": "听说阿尔戈族长会来，族长人在哪里？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6054a82ebfba872defffb24de89bdfc2bf4fc0c6defd4c72e98cfffe7948a59c",
      "source_sha256": "3a949a24fa327e289e6c933d4d8ef916378d052486cca59ba250a7d265ccae2a",
      "translation": "阿尔戈族长。既然你已经来了，剩下的事，就只有两件了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8b951e221c5345c598b6bcea42f026d41454e628c775ea6de85c7f3cbda64440",
      "source_sha256": "ea5465ead723d37c936e664b70eae5bbc9d2ba2df1d50228ccf7486939b8312d",
      "translation": "第一件，是在这里重新召集青月特雷瓦族人，重建村庄。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2c7778b82dd11f25fd46d6b9116f42d525fe4523ec6c624df06e67eccdf70eac",
      "source_sha256": "cde1e32881491aaf3c71edf098163aa2ff66405c47e714907b92d9650fcb701f",
      "translation": "随着时间流逝，青月特雷瓦族人知道这里之后，就会陆续赶来……总有一天能实现吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b2d5c773086dc9777233a4b08d13c45fe780f3ef6bf05be794dabcbc260985ad",
      "source_sha256": "7282003acfbc023a672d7d7d9b93108bd64228f2a85d9bb7f898487a38aa04b4",
      "translation": "第二件，是由族长亲自夺回，被黑角部族抢走的青月之傲——[圣物]。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a4ffefc852367ee350a60553cfb830c0ef1ef60ba3f4e7ad9d4592877d410cd0",
      "source_sha256": "366e47b9fa36f3de9a0e0c5339cf0d01711475c60b08ec4ec3ab712c24d64a76",
      "translation": "只有夺回那些圣物，我们青月的族人才会再次承认，你是我们的族长。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89b6b7b485455ac4eb839e4018ee9b7031d887905effbf6f2516db79139285fc",
      "source_sha256": "20f2324e0f0bb3403c9b7928780789f00a2c1c46ad47085ad9d9f1a7e6f93c72",
      "translation": "为过去悔恨的日子，已经结束了。现在，为了未来，站起来吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:84e96b79f79dd40398e16e77d55127e47db61cd160e719896866a8561aed833b",
      "source_sha256": "e07865d52df4fd69f89559054a9311a8c0c7f36f7a2aa22a7481a5fe5378ff56",
      "translation": "你身为青月的一员，仍未丢掉那份自豪，我由衷地感到欣慰。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:56aef989e334e657cdc5f31580d9992a5c5e92e9fcd7f17b347b80915abe6e6d",
      "source_sha256": "f83b762f1813c8a75dce930870a5674217d9869da436124a443766410625579b",
      "translation": "听说，黑角特雷瓦与北部军联手，现在都在贝尔福特，混上了一席之地。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e21083203f98a6c5fc2860b6aa603f43358e7d7fa157bc66a275e717cbf26be6",
      "source_sha256": "8daea9d5c7667ba7625e4ff5961d9f7bd2e0774c95eb5ab9bc2b250debf232a5",
      "translation": "必须从他们手中，夺回所有青月圣物。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:20d9fd583709e930f1e571e35186224352f560fc9b343544dd2c851b4b4aad01",
      "source_sha256": "4e7b98017d7d0a92221db50971c312696de8078f495cab27242d23e746e620f5",
      "translation": "那些圣物，将安放在重新崛起的青月村庄中央。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ae1eacdb4a317d5418ae7c8742adff75fda4f323f6f30c16ae02fad3b73047e1",
      "source_sha256": "10aee411a45111b6b3ac93cb8fcfb8303f8fb27aecfb43e7a5f99333dcbf6785",
      "translation": "我原本以为，对阿尔戈族长的背叛者评价，是一场误会。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cdbb1547fbfb2a5d441658154a62d2cf892ea875d38b58dca3d91fb36cafb956",
      "source_sha256": "d3b04de970b370bb57d34d205a09a391222f88c147dbb492899429ebe0f8f44a",
      "translation": "希望你不要让我改变这个想法。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c926718d762cb88335c9555895cfd5d7041692ec1e82653991caa92d31f9c319",
      "source_sha256": "53b32a6250503481f2f8d2d94ee884d6b52f4be5a78ef280cfefa62adb96aa95",
      "translation": "去从贝尔福特的[暗黑特雷瓦头领]们手中，夺回所有青月圣物吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a5b66631abd0d4c169a0f84d16fa7c6608a2147479f058da03e079ade90e0b1d",
      "source_sha256": "a5b86cd034974daa14c83f7bbfb239e2dc3035763c7dda21c828f260cef4f61e",
      "translation": "愿青月再度复兴。我会将象征族长身份的青月武器，归还给你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3dee621ae815c761ac8798a821530da6ece98a33de05afb88c6b43a8a223ae73",
      "source_sha256": "18f85099147619ec25369a934843da0a0844bf39fe7b18583232508d21395c83",
      "translation": "青月圣物"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:001b746f199ab5b81a2a23aaf1c8e9d89d1f89005a78446d250ce8a676dbc576",
